  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Changed the `ClassFactory` API. Use `ClassFactory.For` to create instances now.\n        - The instance of `ClassFactory` doesn't need to be referenced anymore. It will say alive on its own until `Release` is called.\n        - Fixed the signature of `GetFunctionInfo2` and `GetClassIDInfo2` to take a `Span` instead of a `ReadOnlySpan`.\n        - The flags returned by `GetTypeDefProps` are now mapped to the `CorTypeAttr` enum.\n        - Changed the signature of `GetFunctionEnter3Info` to be easier to use.\n        - Added description of common profiler error codes in `HResult`.\n        - `ThrowIfFailed` now puts the description of known errors in the exception message.",
